  <scopecontent id="6ba63d0954faf4693854ffad8779e9ed">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>This collection consists of published official collected state documents including but not limited to: messages to the legislature; vetoes and memos on bills vetoed; messages on legislative bills approved; emergency messages; proclamations; judicial designations; removal proceedings and investigations; pardons and commutations; appointments; and addresses.</p>  </scopecontent>
